# {{ site.fullName }} (IIHE Cambodia)

> IIHE Cambodia is an NCC Education Accredited Partner Centre in Phnom Penh, operated by IIHE Co., Ltd. Students study Level 3, Level 4 and Level 5 qualifications, awarded by NCC Education, face to face on the Phnom Penh campus, then progress to a one-year UK Bachelor's top-up degree, validated and awarded by the University of Greater Manchester and delivered online by Western International College Online (WINC). IIHE Cambodia is accredited by NCC Education, not by the university.

Website languages: English ({{ site.url }}/) and Khmer ({{ site.url }}/km/).

